WEBVTT

00:14:00.123 --> 00:14:01.692
O que fizeste.

00:14:15.144 --> 00:14:16.963
Muito bem. Ok, bom.
Fantástico.

00:14:17.033 --> 00:14:18.844
(Aplausos)

00:14:21.235 --> 00:14:22.436
Obrigado.

00:14:22.546 --> 00:14:24.946
(Aplausos)

00:14:25.296 --> 00:14:28.191
Três versões.

00:14:28.356 --> 00:14:30.726
(Aplausos)